   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="address">
            <address>
               <addrLine>
                  <pb facs="HS00048772X_0028"/>Herrn Guſtav Schwarzkopf</addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb51">Wien I</rs>
               </addrLine>
               <addrLine>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb207301">Tiefer Graben 17</rs>
               </addrLine>
            </address>
         </div>
         <div type="image">
            <p rend="center">
               <pb facs="HS00048772X_0027"/>
               <rs type="place" ref="#pmb245">
                  <hi rend="pre-print">Hotel Esplanade, Berlin</hi>
               </rs>
            </p>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="1">
            <opener>
               <dateline rend="right">
                  <pb facs="HS00048772X_0028"/>
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb168">Berlin</rs>
                  <space unit="chars" quantity="1"/>
                  <date>15. 3. 25</date> </dateline>
            </opener>
            <p>Am <date>14.</date> war hier <rs type="event" ref="#pmb353205" subtype="implied">Première</rs> des <rs type="work" ref="#pmb29823">Märchen</rs> (am <rs type="org" ref="#pmb35053">Lessingtheater</rs>) – 32 Jahre nach <rs type="event" ref="#pmb35068" subtype="implied">
                  <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>
               </rs>. Ich sah mir am gleichen Abend <rs type="event" ref="#pmb210331" subtype="implied">
                  <rs type="work" ref="#pmb81419">Charleys Tante</rs>
               </rs> an <del rend="strikethrough">
                  <unclear>mit</unclear>
               </del> mit Heini<!-- nicht indizieren, ist Autor des Briefes --> als <rs type="work" ref="#pmb81419" subtype="implied">Jack</rs> (singend und tanzend.) Wer mir das am
                  <anchor type="commentary" xml:id="K_L04362-1"/><date>1. Dezember 1893</date><note type="commentary" corresp="K_L04362-1">Dem Tag der <rs type="event" ref="#pmb35068">Uraufführung</rs> am <rs type="org" ref="#pmb36430">Deutschen
                     Volkstheater</rs> in <rs type="place" ref="#pmb50">Wien</rs>.</note>
               prophezeiht hätte. <date>Heute</date> trat  <rs type="person" ref="#pmb12692">Heini</rs> zum 500. Mal auf! –</p>
            <closer>Herzliche Grüße. Ihr <signed>Arthur</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="2">
            <p>
               <handShift scribe="#pmb12692"/>Viele herzliche Grüße</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>Heini.</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
         <div type="writingSession" n="2">
            <p>
               <handShift scribe="#pmb21647"/>Mit beſten Empfehlungen Ihr</p>
            <closer>
               <signed>PaulMarx</signed>
            </closer>
         </div>
      </body>
